      "about": "I bridge operational workflows, business systems, and modern AI capability. With 30 years of engineering and technical leadership experience—backed by eight years co-directing a technical consultancy—I specialise in identifying operational bottlenecks, architecting pragmatic data and AI pipelines, and building custom containerized automation tools. I combine systems thinking with hands-on technical execution (Python, Docker, local/cloud LLMs, n8n) to deliver production-ready solutions that eliminate manual friction, modernize processes, and unlock measurable commercial value."
