      "tags": ["stream:enterprise", "stream:advisory", "layer:leadership", "layer:handson"],
      "about": "I operate as a practical bridge between daily operational workflows, system integrations, and cross-functional team needs. With 30 years across systems engineering, data pipeline alignment, and technical project delivery, I specialise in connecting enterprise SaaS platforms, fixing post-go-live friction, and automating routine administrative workflows. Having co-directed an independent technical consultancy, I bring a grounded, commercial mindset to technology choices—ensuring software integrations protect project margins, simplify data accuracy, and eliminate double-handling."
    },
    "data_product": {
      "title": "Technical Product Director – Data Systems & Digital Integration",
      "tags": ["stream:enterprise", "stream:advisory", "layer:advisory", "layer:leadership"],
      "about": "I operate as a practical bridge between business objectives, complex physical datasets, and engineering teams. With a background spanning systems engineering, data pipeline automation, and technical compliance, I specialise in translating complex, multi-variable engineering challenges into structured documentation, calculation engines, and software requirements. Having co-founded and directed a technical consultancy, I focus on managing cross-functional delivery streams, controlling project scope, and ensuring complex backend logic supports practical commercial outcomes."
