      "title": "Technical Director – Built Environment & Digital Integration",
      "tags": ["stream:advisory", "stream:boutique", "layer:advisory", "layer:leadership"],
      "about": "I work at the intersection of systems research, building performance simulation, and software automation, complemented by practical experience running a small consultancy. I focus on designing automated data pipelines that connect physical building systems to sustainability reporting frameworks, ensuring automation is balanced with human oversight to translate operational metrics into reliable compliance outputs. This combination of hands-on technical experience and business operations helps me act as a practical bridge, translating complex technical datasets into clear, transparent, and auditable structures for senior leadership."
